/a></span>; <em>Broadwell </em>v. <em>Commonwealth, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"7133219\"><a href=\"/opinion/7221111/broadwell-v-commonwealth/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Broadwell v. Commonwealth\">98 Ky. 15</a></span>; <em>Proffer </em>v. <em>Stewart, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"3452913\"><a href=\"/opinion/3454771/proffer-v-stewart-county-judge/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Proffer v. Stewart, County Judge\">259 Ky. 445</a></span>.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}